                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6be58064-6afc-3d92-85a1-8030e51fd46d",
                                        "entry_id": "ad82ceee-60a9-3809-88c2-e00c1ffaa9ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To transport in a boat propelled with oars."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32c22d4a-c9b1-4958-8520-1d2937b1c65e",
                                                "sense_id": "6be58064-6afc-3d92-85a1-8030e51fd46d",
                                                "text": "to row the captain ashore in his barge"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25a5f2fe-fdca-3e35-a33c-e0f573bf11c4",
                                        "entry_id": "ad82ceee-60a9-3809-88c2-e00c1ffaa9ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be moved by oars."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75663b5b-4710-4210-9ee0-2ece52374113",
                                                "sense_id": "25a5f2fe-fdca-3e35-a33c-e0f573bf11c4",
                                                "text": "The boat rows easily."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "row",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "446758e3-a5f9-368f-8611-4b7c81f744cb",
                                        "entry_id": "437f1b9c-c0b6-3e46-aed3-585714152a61",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act or instance of rowing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4969cff4-af48-484c-abb6-21e4002ce3bd",
                                                "sense_id": "446758e3-a5f9-368f-8611-4b7c81f744cb",
                                                "text": "I went for an early-morning row."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d29e642f-cd24-39e0-a7be-c49192bacb14",
                                        "entry_id": "437f1b9c-c0b6-3e46-aed3-585714152a61",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of several thematically similar exercise movements performed with a pulling motion of the arms towards the back."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "row",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8cdd1c90-57ea-3531-820a-afab016a385b",
                                        "entry_id": "4006a5a2-db7a-32ba-9481-76d51165ddea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A noisy argument."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d05df533-089f-4d43-9ac6-589154e23e72",
                                                "sense_id": "8cdd1c90-57ea-3531-820a-afab016a385b",
                                                "text": "There was a row among the oarsmen about how to row."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "884395c7-228c-40f6-9a5b-396c8c38fad8",
                                                "sense_id": "8cdd1c90-57ea-3531-820a-afab016a385b",
                                                "text": "In the autumn there was a row at some cement works about the unskilled labour men. A union had just been started for them and all but a few joined. One of these blacklegs was laid for by a picket and knocked out of time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6578951e-15a5-480d-a93b-8d05190246cf",
                                                "sense_id": "8cdd1c90-57ea-3531-820a-afab016a385b",
                                                "text": "As a rule, you see, I'm not lugged into Family Rows. On the occasions when Aunt is calling to Aunt like mastodons bellowing across primeval swamps and Uncle James's letter about Cousin Mabel's peculiar behaviour is being shot round the family circle... the clan has a tendency to ignore me."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bd49334-81af-44fb-8414-b0246afe449a",
                                                "sense_id": "8cdd1c90-57ea-3531-820a-afab016a385b",
                                                "text": "‘Then the father has a great fight with his terrible conscience,’ said Munday with granite seriousness. ‘Should he make a row with the police […]? Or should he say nothing about it and condone brutality for fear of appearing in the newspapers?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ab16444-188f-4443-b7d8-3b83359b59c2",
                                                "sense_id": "8cdd1c90-57ea-3531-820a-afab016a385b",
                                                "text": "[…]he wrote to me last week telling me about an incredible bitch of a row blazing there on account of someone having been and gone and produced an unofficial magazine called Raddled, full of obscene libellous Oz-like filth. And what I though, what Sammy and I thought, was—why not?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95711273-519f-47fb-9cb4-7f8fa601544a",
                                                "sense_id": "8cdd1c90-57ea-3531-820a-afab016a385b",
                                                "text": "The row comes at a time when Africa is supposed to be moving towards greater free trade through the establishment of a continent-wide free-trade area, which began operating four years ago."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dd29532b-8c90-3fc9-9d07-0d96650eec7f",
                                        "entry_id": "4006a5a2-db7a-32ba-9481-76d51165ddea",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A continual loud noise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de1d7fb1-ce07-4365-b8b1-0731a37316e1",
                                                "sense_id": "dd29532b-8c90-3fc9-9d07-0d96650eec7f",
                                                "text": "Who's making that row?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "row",
