                                                "example_id": "c0ac015a-2f1c-43ff-9810-b1fa460f2008",
                                                "sense_id": "530ed46a-d712-32d8-9006-e1fefa7c1e05",
                                                "text": "and now, glancing my eyes towards that part of his dress which cover'd the essential object of enjoyment, I plainly discover'd the swell and commotion there",
                                                "translation": "Fanny Hill",
